      "title": "By the water",
      "excerpt": "A page from a sketchbook filled along the quay.",
      "body": "<p>I returned to the same stretch of harbour three mornings in a row. The boats scarcely moved, but each day the water called for another blue. This painting grew out of those three small studies.</p>"
